细胞毒性T淋巴细胞中的IFNγ和颗粒酶B表达，并通过抑制组蛋白去乙酰化酶（HDACs，尤其是丁酸和戊酸）发挥表观遗传调控作用。HDAC抑制可上调黑色素瘤细胞的PD-1配体表达、增强抗肿瘤免疫反应、抑制肿瘤内CD4+ T细胞凋亡并抑制肿瘤生长。尽管单变量分析显示多种粪便SCFAs均与延长PFS相关，但多变量调整后仅丙酸（PA）保留独立预后价值，提示其在复杂临床背景下的稳健预测能力。作者强调粪便检测完全无创，具备常规监测潜力，但需进一步验证以确认其作为生物标志物的临床适用性，并指出当前研究未直接分析肠道菌群物种组成与SCFAs的关联，限制了机制链条的完整闭合。\n\n6.  **Check against Constraints:**\n    *   `examples`: One item per study? Yes. `finding` includes specific stats, methods, mechanism/argument? Yes. `conditions` keeps settings/differences? Yes. `use_in_review` specifies role? Yes.\n    *   `explanation`: Covers concepts/principles/mechanisms/synthesis? Yes. No cross-study merging? Yes. Specific and clear? Yes.\n    *   `remaining_points`: Note important unanswered questions. The paper mentions: dietary intake timing relative to treatment is unclear; gut microbiome species/diversity not analyzed so link to SCFAs unknown; needs validation cohort. I'll list these briefly.\n    *   Format: Strict JSON.\n    *   Language: Chinese.\n    *   Check quantitative results: HRs and CIs are correctly attached to metrics and subjects. Conditions preserved.\n    *   Check attribution: \"本研究\" used.\n    *   Check reference_ids: Optional, leave empty or fill if obvious. I'll leave empty as instructed (\"方便时可以填写，否则留空\").\n    *   Verify JSON structure matches exactly: `{\"question_material\": [{\"question_id\": \"Q01\", \"examples\": [...], \"explanation\": \"...\", \"remaining_points\": []}]}`\n\n    All looks solid. I will generate the JSON now.\n    One minor check: The prompt says \"不同作者/论文分别成项，不要把两项研究合写...同一篇论文的多个实验可以分别成项。\" This is a single cohort study with one main analysis pipeline, so one example item is appropriate.\n    I will ensure the JSON is perfectly formatted.\n    Let's draft carefully. \n    Structure:\n    ```json\n    {\n  \"question_material\": [\n    {\n      \"question_id\": \"Q01\",\n      \"examples\": [\n        {\n          \"attribution\": \"本研究\",\n          \"use_in_review\": \"直接提供粪便SCFA水平与PD-1i疗效（PFS）关联的单变量统计值，并明确丙酸（P